          "value": "The user has a strong interest in creatively fulfilling weekend getaways involving music. They have explored music history research (found it tedious), attended live performances, created playlists, launched a podcast on traditional/electronic music fusion, and enrolled in an audio production workshop. They value personal expression, authentic engagement, and hands-on creative activities over passive consumption. They also enjoy blending nature with music, as shown by recording natural sounds for tracks. They have had negative experiences with hiking dates (found it tiring and not enjoyable) and collaborative band settings (felt stifled by disagreements). They dropped out of an audio production course after one week due to feeling overwhelmed. They have enjoyed attending a singles club with engaging activities and meeting new people. They prefer focusing on what truly inspires them, such as creating their own tracks, and find fulfillment in hands-on, authentic creative pursuits.",
